WEBVTT

1
00:00:57.791 --> 00:01:02.458
In verses 16.13 to 16.15 of Chapter 16,

2
00:01:02.458 --> 00:01:03.750
Lord Krishna reveals

3
00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:06.750
the thinking of demoniac persons.

4
00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:10.250
After gathering wealth through unjust means,

5
00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:14.125
their ego is fully exposed.

6
00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:17.666
Dominated by pride, the illusion of ownership,

7
00:01:17.666 --> 00:01:21.000
and the belief in their own control, such people

8
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.875
consider themselves the doer, the enjoyer
and the controller,

9
00:01:24.875 --> 00:01:27.708
and forget the role of destiny,

10
00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:30.625
karma, and the Supreme.

11
00:01:35.208 --> 00:01:37.625
‘Idamadya maya labdham’,

12
00:01:37.625 --> 00:01:41.083
that is, ‘Today I have gained this.’

13
00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:44.125
The word maya here shows

14
00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:46.291
that they credit every achievement

15
00:01:46.291 --> 00:01:48.791
only to themselves.

16
00:01:48.791 --> 00:01:51.708
In their view, nothing else matters.

17
00:01:51.708 --> 00:01:56.250
Not the law of karma, not grace,
not the workings of God.

18
00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.416
One thought prevails.

19
00:01:58.416 --> 00:02:00.708
‘I did it all.’

20
00:02:00.708 --> 00:02:04.666
Then they say, ‘imam prapsye manorathm’,

21
00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:07.708
‘Now this desire of mine will be fulfilled.’

22
00:02:07.708 --> 00:02:11.541
Manoratha - the chariot of the mind,

23
00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:14.083
on which imagined future pleasures

24
00:02:14.083 --> 00:02:16.875
and plans ride.

25
00:02:16.875 --> 00:02:20.000
The mind constantly races ahead,

26
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.666
toward imagined enjoyments and comforts.

27
00:02:23.666 --> 00:02:28.166
‘Idamasti idamapi me bhavishyati
punar dhanam’,

28
00:02:28.166 --> 00:02:33.041
that is - ‘This wealth is mine,
and I will gain even more.’

29
00:02:33.041 --> 00:02:36.166
Here there is no place for contentment.

30
00:02:36.166 --> 00:02:38.541
The moment something is obtained,
the very next

31
00:02:38.541 --> 00:02:41.875
moment the plan for the next
acquisition is formed.

32
00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:46.750
Desire does not stop, it only expands.

33
00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:49.666
Then comes the view of power, ‘Asau

34
00:02:49.666 --> 00:02:53.916
maya hatah shatruh hanishye chaparanapi’,

35
00:02:53.916 --> 00:02:54.750
‘This enemy

36
00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:58.708
I have defeated, and I will remove others too.’

37
00:02:58.708 --> 00:03:00.541
This is not mere competition,

38
00:03:00.541 --> 00:03:03.583
but a mindset of destruction.

39
00:03:03.583 --> 00:03:06.000
For them, success means

40
00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.250
dominance over others.

41
00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:11.250
The delusion deepens further.

42
00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:17.000
‘Ishvaroham, aham bhogi’, that is -
‘I am the controller,

43
00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.041
I am the enjoyer.’

44
00:03:19.041 --> 00:03:22.375
These roles belong only to the Supreme,

45
00:03:22.375 --> 00:03:26.791
but ego claims them for itself.

46
00:03:26.791 --> 00:03:28.208
The truth is

47
00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:30.916
they cannot even control their own breath,

48
00:03:30.916 --> 00:03:35.625
yet they claim complete mastery.

49
00:03:35.625 --> 00:03:39.083
‘Siddhoham balavan sukhi’, that is -

50
00:03:39.083 --> 00:03:43.958
‘I am accomplished, powerful, and happy.’

51
00:03:43.958 --> 00:03:48.250
Here there is no humility, no acceptance.

52
00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:51.375
As if the mind, deep within,

53
00:03:51.375 --> 00:03:54.083
crowns itself as king.

54
00:03:54.083 --> 00:03:57.958
Even religious acts become mere performance.

55
00:03:57.958 --> 00:04:01.416
‘Yakshye, dasyami, modishye’,

56
00:04:01.416 --> 00:04:03.541
that is, ‘I will perform sacrifice,

57
00:04:03.541 --> 00:04:06.833
give in charity, and enjoy.’

58
00:04:06.833 --> 00:04:10.000
These acts happen outwardly, but within,

59
00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.000
devotion and surrender do not awaken.

60
00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.458
Finally, their entire trust rests only

61
00:04:16.458 --> 00:04:18.333
on illusion.

62
00:04:18.333 --> 00:04:22.708
Wealth, power, and position
are all impermanent,

63
00:04:22.708 --> 00:04:25.750
but ignorance treats them as eternal.

64
00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:29.000
And this very illusion sows the seeds of sorrow,

65
00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:33.166
which tightens the bondage of life.

66
00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.750
The demoniac tendency

67
00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:44.250
does not always come as noise or violence.

68
00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:49.500
Often it is very subtle.

69
00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:54.333
Like when you begin to believe within –

70
00:04:54.333 --> 00:04:57.416
‘I am running everything.

71
00:04:57.416 --> 00:05:02.208
I am the cause of my own success.

72
00:05:02.208 --> 00:05:05.791
I am the master of life.

73
00:05:05.791 --> 00:05:10.291
I can enjoy however I wish.’

74
00:05:10.291 --> 00:05:11.791
I have called

75
00:05:11.791 --> 00:05:16.125
this mindset in these verses –

76
00:05:16.125 --> 00:05:21.208
‘Ishvaroham aham bhogi’,

77
00:05:21.208 --> 00:05:23.291
that is,

78
00:05:23.291 --> 00:05:26.083
‘I am the controller,

79
00:05:26.083 --> 00:05:30.000
and I am the enjoyer.’

80
00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.791
But

81
00:05:31.791 --> 00:05:34.083
pause for a moment

82
00:05:34.083 --> 00:05:37.916
and look around.

83
00:05:37.916 --> 00:05:43.833
Can you control your own breath?

84
00:05:43.833 --> 00:05:49.208
Can you control your heartbeat?

85
00:05:49.208 --> 00:05:51.500
Can you control the cycle of seasons

86
00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.333
or the behaviour

87
00:05:54.333 --> 00:05:55.875
of others?

88
00:05:55.875 --> 00:05:58.875
You cannot.

89
00:05:58.875 --> 00:06:01.291
Yet ego

90
00:06:01.291 --> 00:06:06.083
holds on to this illusion.

91
00:06:06.083 --> 00:06:08.708
The more you feed it,

92
00:06:08.708 --> 00:06:11.833
the more pride, anxiety,

93
00:06:11.833 --> 00:06:16.000
and suffering grow.

94
00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.500
You work hard

95
00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:21.166
so that you can enjoy,

96
00:06:21.166 --> 00:06:23.541
but for how long?

97
00:06:23.541 --> 00:06:26.875
In how much quantity?

98
00:06:26.875 --> 00:06:29.125
Indulgence ultimately

99
00:06:29.125 --> 00:06:33.333
becomes empty and burdensome.

100
00:06:33.333 --> 00:06:35.000
The belief

101
00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:40.375
that more power or pleasure will complete you

102
00:06:40.375 --> 00:06:43.833
is only illusion.

103
00:06:43.833 --> 00:06:46.458
It binds the soul in restlessness

104
00:06:46.458 --> 00:06:51.416
and agitation.

105
00:06:51.416 --> 00:06:54.166
True peace comes

106
00:06:54.166 --> 00:07:00.041
when you step down from this imaginary throne.

107
00:07:00.041 --> 00:07:03.916
You are not the master, but a seeker

108
00:07:03.916 --> 00:07:08.000
under a higher power.

109
00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:13.291
And when you accept this truth,

110
00:07:13.291 --> 00:07:16.000
life becomes lighter,

111
00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.250
humility comes,

112
00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:22.333
and grace appears.

113
00:07:22.333 --> 00:07:27.041
I assure you –

114
00:07:27.041 --> 00:07:28.375
those who

115
00:07:28.375 --> 00:07:32.083
give up the illusion of taking My place

116
00:07:32.083 --> 00:07:36.666
and live a life of integrity,

117
00:07:36.666 --> 00:07:38.708
them I Myself

118
00:07:38.708 --> 00:07:41.000
protect,

119
00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:45.708
and I lighten their burden.

120
00:07:50.125 --> 00:07:52.375
When your relationships

121
00:07:52.375 --> 00:07:57.875
begin to run on ego and the desire to enjoy,

122
00:07:57.875 --> 00:08:00.541
the sacred feeling of the home

123
00:08:00.541 --> 00:08:04.458
slowly begins to disappear.

124
00:08:04.458 --> 00:08:06.375
I have said –

125
00:08:06.375 --> 00:08:10.000
‘Ishvaroham aham bhogi’.

126
00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:13.791
‘I am the controller, and I am

127
00:08:13.791 --> 00:08:15.500
the enjoyer.’

128
00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:20.333
This is the demoniac mindset.

129
00:08:20.333 --> 00:08:23.500
When this enters the home,

130
00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:27.791
family members cease to be simply people.

131
00:08:27.791 --> 00:08:32.583
They become reflections of your pride.

132
00:08:32.583 --> 00:08:36.958
You take pride in your partner, your children,

133
00:08:36.958 --> 00:08:40.500
your parents,

134
00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:43.541
not for who they truly are,

135
00:08:43.541 --> 00:08:45.000
but because

136
00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:48.166
they make you look good in society.

137
00:08:48.166 --> 00:08:52.666
As long as they shine, you are happy.

138
00:08:52.666 --> 00:08:55.166
But the moment they stumble

139
00:08:55.166 --> 00:08:58.583
or appear ordinary,

140
00:08:58.583 --> 00:09:00.791
you begin to distance yourself.

141
00:09:00.791 --> 00:09:03.125
This is not love.

142
00:09:03.125 --> 00:09:06.791
It is only the outer covering of ownership,

143
00:09:06.791 --> 00:09:11.291
given the name of affection.

144
00:09:11.291 --> 00:09:16.375
And this is what leaves everyone alone within,

145
00:09:16.375 --> 00:09:19.583
even while living under the same roof.

146
00:09:19.583 --> 00:09:24.666
I want you to see the soul,

147
00:09:24.666 --> 00:09:28.833
not only the position or the image.

148
00:09:28.833 --> 00:09:29.958
When you

149
00:09:29.958 --> 00:09:33.083
respect each other beyond roles

150
00:09:33.083 --> 00:09:36.375
and titles,

151
00:09:36.375 --> 00:09:41.250
the atmosphere of the home fills with divinity.

152
00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:42.666
Reflect on this.

153
00:09:47.166 --> 00:09:49.000
You are intelligent,

154
00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.000
skilled, and bright.

155
00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:53.833
But

156
00:09:53.833 --> 00:09:57.125
if the feeling arises within

157
00:09:57.125 --> 00:09:59.541
that ‘I did it all,

158
00:09:59.541 --> 00:10:04.166
I am the master, I am the enjoyer’,

159
00:10:04.166 --> 00:10:06.958
then understand,

160
00:10:06.958 --> 00:10:11.458
you have already begun drifting in
a dangerous direction.

161
00:10:11.458 --> 00:10:15.041
I have called this very mindset –

162
00:10:15.041 --> 00:10:19.791
‘Ishvaroham aham bhogi’.

163
00:10:19.791 --> 00:10:22.125
This is the illusion of complete control

164
00:10:22.125 --> 00:10:26.750
and ownership.

165
00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:28.583
When sharp intelligence

166
00:10:28.583 --> 00:10:32.041
begins to eliminate humility,

167
00:10:32.041 --> 00:10:35.208
it starts to disconnect from people.

168
00:10:35.208 --> 00:10:39.750
Colleagues genuinely become instruments.

169
00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:42.125
Lesser people become a ladder,

170
00:10:42.125 --> 00:10:45.166
and greater people an obstacle.

171
00:10:45.166 --> 00:10:49.458
The workplace stops being a place of contribution

172
00:10:49.458 --> 00:10:51.458
and becomes a battlefield.

173
00:10:51.458 --> 00:10:54.958
You may win awards,

174
00:10:54.958 --> 00:10:57.625
fulfil responsibilities,

175
00:10:57.625 --> 00:11:00.291
and even lead a team.

176
00:11:00.291 --> 00:11:03.833
But if the heart

177
00:11:03.833 --> 00:11:06.125
is empty within,

178
00:11:06.125 --> 00:11:09.291
true fulfilment never comes.

179
00:11:09.291 --> 00:11:13.666
Pride isolates.

180
00:11:13.666 --> 00:11:16.416
It chases recognition

181
00:11:16.416 --> 00:11:21.666
and quietly destroys trust.

182
00:11:21.666 --> 00:11:24.791
True success comes from connection

183
00:11:24.791 --> 00:11:28.041
and remaining grounded.

184
00:11:28.041 --> 00:11:32.708
Stay humble and accept grace.

185
00:11:32.708 --> 00:11:37.875
Remember, your talent is a gift,

186
00:11:37.875 --> 00:11:40.458
not a crown that grants entitlement.

187
00:11:40.458 --> 00:11:44.541
When you lead with humility,

188
00:11:44.541 --> 00:11:48.958
your influence spreads far,

189
00:11:48.958 --> 00:11:52.750
and your team stands

190
00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.958
with you in firm trust.
